1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,851
Zara: I ordered a pizza. I did NOT order
that.

2
00:00:03,521 --> 00:00:06,884
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: The Last Floor. Part
one of three: the lobby.

3
00:00:07,554 --> 00:00:09,913
Zara: Nope. Nope. Nope.

4
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:12,083
Bell: Zara! Behind me!

5
00:00:12,753 --> 00:00:16,020
Bell: Elevators beep and open. Zombies
love that.

6
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:19,259
Bell: Ding. Going down. Basement.

7
00:00:19,929 --> 00:00:23,149
Bell: Evac helicopter. Roof. Six a.m.

8
00:00:23,819 --> 00:00:25,897
Zara: Twelve floors. In the dark.

9
00:00:26,017 --> 00:00:27,205
Bell: Then we start now.

10
00:00:27,875 --> 00:00:31,511
Bell: Zombies hate stairs. No hands for
the rail.

11
00:00:32,181 --> 00:00:34,396
Zara: Floor two. Every door is open.

12
00:00:35,066 --> 00:00:36,692
Bell: Close them. One by one.

13
00:00:37,362 --> 00:00:39,075
Omar: Don't hurt me! I'm a chef!

14
00:00:39,745 --> 00:00:40,895
Omar: I brought my pan.

15
00:00:41,015 --> 00:00:42,514
Zara: A pan is not a plan.

16
00:00:43,184 --> 00:00:45,973
Omar: Also, meet Pip. Mrs. Lin's parrot.

17
00:00:46,643 --> 00:00:48,107
Pip: Open the door! Open the door!

18
00:00:48,227 --> 00:00:50,294
Bell: Pip. Not that sentence.

19
00:00:50,964 --> 00:00:52,623
Zara: Something is climbing after us.

20
00:00:53,293 --> 00:00:59,047
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part one of three, The
Last Floor. Next: the stairs. Follow for part two.

